cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this gold set or cite these reports, please cite the repository."
title: "Legal Studio Benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: Ciarrocki
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: "https://github.com/ciarrocki/legal-studio-benchmark"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - legal
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - benchmark
  - Delaware corporate law
  - evaluation
abstract: >-
  A reviewed gold set for retrieval-grounded question answering over Delaware
  corporate law, with published evaluation reports. Contamination is measured
  per record against a named closed-book control; nothing unreviewed is gold;
  expected authorities are resolved against the corpus, never written by hand.
